XR window: the eyes' mask as a portal in the room (mode ventana)

aurora_xr_set_diorama_window and fade[3] 2: the table's space is a window's (x, y within +-1 over its
rectangle, z in metres, +z toward the player). A point behind its plane stays where the line from the
eye to it crosses the rectangle; a point in front (coming out) within the game camera's near frustum
(the rectangle narrowing toward the camera's eye, in front of the window on the player's side), up to
the pop-out's depth and never past the camera. Each eye's position in the table's space comes from
tableFromHead and half the distance between the eyes (from the eye shift and the projection).

